{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":789,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Unreleased Content"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks has not been implemented in the actual game, though it may have been in testing places, teased by the developers or left unused in-game."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Because of this, not all information on the item in question is known and certain information may not be entirely accurate. Additionally, whenever it will be added in the future is not always clear."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perk"]}," were a feature which allowed the player to apply enhancements to towers; these enhancements would boost the effectiveness of towers in various ways, such as increasing damage inflicted by towers or applying debuffs to them. Only a menu for them was implemented into the game in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hardcore_Testing_BETA","title":"Hardcore Testing BETA"},"children":["Hardcore Testing BETA"]},", but it was later removed in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V1.0.0","title":"V1.0.0"},"children":["Solar Eclipse Update"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This feature has been confirmed to be scrapped",{"type":"sup","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Perks#cite_note-1"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwDw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwEA"},"children":["["]},"1",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwEQ"},"children":["]"]}]}]}]}," due to it creating balancing issues and it making support towers obsolete. The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Skills","title":"Skills"},"children":["Skills"]}," feature can, however, be considered the replacement for ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks"]},"."]},"\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Obtainment_Method"},"children":["Obtainment Method"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFw"},"children":[]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":["Tier II Perk Crate animation"]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks"]}," would be mainly obtained from crates, however, it is not known how exactly the crates would be obtained. There were three crates that gave ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks"]},", all of which tiered, starting from tier I up to tier III. As there are also three tiers of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perks"]},", it is likely each tiered crate gave perks of equivalent tier. They would be opened similar to crates, where they would drop from the sky into the crate room and then be opened, showing the obtained ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Perk"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"table","props":{"id":"mwIA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"td","props":{"id":"mwIw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwJA"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:PerkICrate.png"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"td","props":{"id":"mwKA"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwKQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:PerkIICrate.png"},"childre